          "settings": {
            "title": "How to clean the inside?",
            "icon": "droplets",
            "use_product_description": false,
            "open_by_default": false,
            "content": "<p>Add 1 tablespoon of lemon juice, 1 teaspoon of salt and a splash of warm water. Swirl for about 2 minutes, pour it out and rinse with plain water until it runs clear. Let the bottle air-dry upside down with the cap off.</p><p>Soap is not needed. If you prefer it, a drop of mild dish soap is fine; rinse well. Never use the dishwasher, scouring pads or metal brushes.</p><p>Full step-by-step guide: <a href=\"/pages/how-to-clean\" title=\"How to clean a copper water bottle\"><u>How to clean a copper water bottle</u></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
